TEXT -2064 840 Left 2 !.tran 1
TEXT -2416 -216 Left 2 ;For deepsleep votages\n \nUnset DeepOff\nIt will short R7 and use only 2mOhm (M2) and 14.84mOhm R6. The readings should max 82mV (scale top) between INA+ and INA-\nwhen 4.86A is passing through. It will read 40uV (scale bottom) when 2.38mA is passing through.\n \nSet DeepOff\nIt will let current pass through R7 and R6. The readings should max 82mV (scale top) between INA+ and INA-\nwhen 10.22mA is passing through. It will read 40uV (scale bottom) when 4.99uA is passing through.
